# API endpoint notes (client package)

Health probes for the **versioned** contract live under **`/api/v1/health/live`** and **`/api/v1/health/ready`** in the public OpenAPI spec (`servers[0].url: /api/v1`).

Root aliases **`/health/live`** and **`/health/ready`** may exist for ops; they are not required for Spectator validation on the same prefix.

The client package uses **`createHealthCheck`** against **`GET …/health/live`** relative to **`baseURL`** (Mode B typically already includes `/api/v1`).
